   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Fated for Fortune</em></p>\n<p>Some have asked you: \"Are you lucky because you have miracles by your side, or do you have miracles by your side because you're lucky?\" The answer was obvious, you are naturally lucky and your technique merely reflects that. You roll all dice generated by your cursed technique twice, picking the result of the higher one. Additionally, you can make a miracle die roll its maximum amount once per long rest.</p>",
